  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RESILAND CA+ Program Kyrgyz Republic Resilient Landscape Restoration Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the project are: (i) to increase the area under sustainable landscape management in Selected Locations in the Kyrgyz Republic; and (ii) to promote Kyrgyz Republic&#x2019;s collaboration with other Central Asian countries on transboundary landscape restoration.</narrative>
  </description>
